    "text": {
     "en": "We must be healthy so that our bodies and minds work well.\nAsk yourself: Did I brush my teeth today? Did I take a shower? Did I comb my hair? Did I wash my hands with soap? Are my nails trimmed and clean?\nBrush twice a day, once after waking up and once before sleeping.\nRinse your mouth after eating.\nWash hands with soap after the toilet and after coming home from outdoors.\nClean habits keep diseases away."
    }
